{"overview":"سَنم، دختری خیال‌پرداز با آرزوهای تبدیل شدن به نویسنده‌ی مشهور، در نهایت در یک آژانس تبلیغاتی کار می‌کند تا از ازدواج ترتیب‌داده‌شده جلوگیری کند. در آنجا، او رئیس خود، چان، را می‌شناسد و در طوفان عشقی و پیچیدگی‌ها گرفتار می‌شود. آیا می‌تواند قلب خود را در حالی که به دنبال رویاهایش می‌رود، محافظت کند؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"Sanem, a dreamy girl with hopes of becoming a famous writer, ends up working at an ad agency to avoid an arranged marriage. There, she meets her boss, Çan, and falls into a whirlwind of love and complications. Can she protect her heart while chasing her dreams?","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":51,"y":2018,"poster":"/q3W3WBoprwN4Nru8BQAOTlN0CIO.jpg"}],"episodes":51,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Demet Özdemir","role":"Sanem Aydın","photo":"/2nOPPPxPjz11N1RcpDXiTiyDYv2.jpg"},{"name":"Can Yaman","role":"Can Divit","photo":"/qjDCqpngema0dqF1DDEbOKrXC1Z.jpg"},{"name":"Birand Tunca","role":"Emre Divit","photo":"/uRTNsnpW54W3VggQp6BJw0Ub4aF.jpg"},{"name":"Öznur Serçeler","role":"Leyla Aydın","photo":"/cW7R6D12Gltl07YdQT8gg5SjRaS.jpg"},{"name":"Ceren Taşçı","role":"Ayhan Işık","photo":"/osj8CastVcLR4F1NLX62HctzIUQ.jpg"},{"name":"Sevcan Yaşar","role":"Aylin Yüksel","photo":"/z2lFS5bf3bEi9Ur6TwAyhhhOx2y.jpg"},{"name":"Anıl Çelik","role":"Cengiz \"Cey Cey\" Özdemir","photo":"/xALa3e9oRiwOWODoAEjyUzN78V1.jpg"},{"name":"Tuan Tunalı","role":"Metin","photo":"/b4AxpXK5k2CYkkueFTcG7hvI7qj.jpg"},{"name":"Özlem Tokaslan","role":"Mevkibe Aydın","photo":"/zUTpXpDQCOEeMvY5Rbs3qCq0qx.jpg"},{"name":"Berat Yenilmez","role":"Nihat Aydın","photo":"/1vVva5ByACBdOkTM4UjOd8gmsUR.jpg"},{"name":"Tuğçe Kumral","role":"Deren Keskin","photo":"/g4lun3S1vCAIvXPY2vBotsGOCzq.jpg"},{"name":"Sibel Şişman","role":"Güliz Yıldırım","photo":"/uGp4nQqOx6vpMYgnRMuimcsP6EP.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"TR":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80411-erkenci-kus/watch?locale=TR","p":[{"n":"puhutv